@startuml
title Partner Administration - BIAN Control Record UML
' Machine-readable reconstruction of the raster BIAN Control Record diagram
' Service Domain: Partner Administration
' Source image: partner-administration-bom-uml.png
' BIAN source: https://bian.org/servicelandscape-14-0-0/views/view_52063.html
' Extraction: raster reconstruction; labels normalized where legible
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction

class "Partner Administration" as SD <<ServiceDomain>>
class "Partner Administrative Plan" as CRT <<ControlRecord>>
class "Administrative Plan" as GA <<GenericArtifact>>
class "Routine" as BQT <<BehaviorQualifierType>>

class "CR Partner Administrative Plan Instance Record" as CRI <<ControlRecordInstance>> {
  + Partner Administrative Plan Management : Management
  + Partner Administrative Plan Budget : Amount
  + Partner Administrative Plan Budget Allocation : Amount
  + Partner Administrative Plan Associated Party : Identifier
  + Partner Administrative Plan Policy : Arrangement
  + Partner Administrative Plan Role Type : RoleType
  + Partner Administrative Plan Description : Text
  + Partner Administrative Plan Reference : Identifier
  + Partner Administrative Plan Type : PlanType
  + Partner Administrative Plan Budget Value : Amount
}

SD "1" --> "1" CRT : defines control record
CRT "1" --> "0..*" CRI : instantiated as
CRT --> GA : conforms to generic artifact
GA --> BQT : qualified by

note right of CRI
  Source was a low-resolution PNG-only BIAN diagram.
  Text has been normalized for machine-readable context.
end note

@enduml
